# tree (FDT) blob counts, DT table entry counts, a synthetic index witness checked for membership
# and binding only, and an R4 operation whose selected board id, revision and selection source
# are always null. Everything here is synthetic: no phone, no network, no process, no block
# device, no real firmware. The image and device tree bytes are generated at runtime by
# tests/myron-fixtures/boot_images.py and tests/myron-fixtures/selection.py, independently of
# the parser, and exist only in a temporary directory: no binary fixture is committed.
